{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02995","headline":"感遇十二首 七 · 张九龄","name":"感遇十二首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江南有丹橘，经冬犹绿林。\n岂伊地气暖，自有岁寒心。\n可以荐嘉客，奈何阻重深。\n运命唯所遇，循环不可寻。\n徒言树桃李，此木岂无阴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02995.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02995","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","citation":"霍松林"}